&gt;
The position reports to the Electronic Systems Manager and is part of Voyager Lunar Systems based in Pittsburgh, PA. This role is hybrid based in Pittsburgh, PA.
&gt;
In this role, the essential functions are:
&gt;
Design PCBs for spacecraft&#x27;s primary and secondary avionics systems.
&gt;
Perform trade studies on electronic components and select the best options for engineering and flight avionics units.
&gt;
Develop test procedures for component, board-level and system-level integrated testing.
&gt;
Testing of fabricated PCBs or integrated avionics systems
